description:
Design a 3-to-8 decoder circuit that takes a 3-bit input and activates one of the eight output lines. Depending on the value of the 3-bit input, exactly one of the outputs will be set to HIGH, while all other outputs will remain LOW. The output lines correspond to the binary value of the input, effectively translating the 3-bit binary representation into a single active output line among eight possible options.
