Design a synchronous 8-bit counter with reset and clear functionality. The counter increments on each positive clock edge when enabled. If the reset (rst) or clear (clr) signals are activated, the counter resets to zero. The output q reflects the current value of the counter, providing an 8-bit representation of the count.
